			<name>Acidic Ray (Sp)</name>
			<description>You can fire an acidic ray as a standard action, targeting any foe within 30 feet as a ranged touch attack. The acidic ray deals 1d6 + 1 points of acid damage. You can use this ability 8 times per day.</description>
			<type>CLASS FEATURE.SORCERER CLASS FEATURE.ABERRANT BLOODLINE ~ POWER LVL 01.SORCERER BLOODLINE POWER.SPECIALATTACK.SPELLLIKE</type>
			<associated></associated>
