		</special_quality>
			<name>Bloodline Arcana</name>
			<description>Whenever you cast a spell of the polymorph subschool, increase the duration of the spell by 50% (minimum 1 round). This bonus does not stack with the increase granted by the Extend Spell feat.</description>
